      "flowchart TB\n\n  v_n0[\"cam gets DMA-BUF via <br/>virtual pipeline\"]\n  v_n1[\"Check buffered request; add <br/>to waiting list\"]\n  v_n2[\"Prepared request handed to <br/>device async\"]\n  v_n3[\"Writable DMA-BUF map within <br/>CPU write sync\"]\n  v_n4[\"CPU tries NV12 conversion <br/>to mapped buffer\"]\n  v_n5{\"Is Virtual2 NV12 conversion <br/>result non-zero?\"}\n  v_n6[\"Buffer-done signal for <br/>either frame status\"]\n  v_n7{\"All request buffers done? <br/>(completeBuffer)\"}\n  v_n8[\"Marks the current request <br/>as complete\"]\n  v_n9[\"Notify cam callback in <br/>submission order\"]\n  v_n10[\"This handler call ends; <br/>request incomplete\"]\n  v_n0 -->|\"After prep, submit request <br/>with buffers\"| v_n1\n  v_n1 -->|\"Prepared request moves to <br/>virtual handoff\"| v_n2\n  v_n2 -->|\"After handoff, frame <br/>processing maps buffer\"| v_n3\n  v_n3 -->|\"Same CPU write sync scope\"| v_n4\n  v_n4 -->|\"Conversion ret decides <br/>generateFrame result\"| v_n5\n  v_n5 -->|\"true (non-zero): FrameError <br/>set [true]\"| v_n6\n  v_n5 -->|\"false (0): FrameSuccess <br/>kept [false]\"| v_n6\n  v_n6 -->|\"Connected handler receives <br/>the signal\"| v_n7\n  v_n7 -->|\"true (all buffers done) <br/>[true]\"| v_n8\n  v_n7 -->|\"false: some buffers still <br/>pending [false]\"| v_n10\n  v_n8 -->|\"In submission order; held <br/>if earlier pending\"| v_n9",
